{"timestamp":"2026-06-13T14:43:28.244+05:30","incident_id":"inc-931bdda26c","service":"payment-api","status":"COMPLETED","severity":"HIGH","root_cause":"Upstream dependency failure, most likely affecting payment_gateway and/or identity_provider interactions; elevated latency is present across /payments/authorize and /payments/capture while host and DB signals remain only moderately elevated.","confidence_score":0.75,"evidence_summary":"29 events for payment-api across payment-01 and payment-02. Primary signals are latency_regression and upstream_api_failure. Max latency reached 1443 ms, average latency was 339.8 ms, with max CPU 71.88%, memory 77.07%, and DB pool 67.33%. Errors span /payments/authorize and /payments/capture and correlate with dependency calls to payment_gateway and identity_provider more than with local resource saturation.","ai_summary":"Fallback RCA for payment-api indicates upstream dependency failure with moderate confidence. The latency spike is distributed across both hosts and key payment endpoints, while CPU and DB pool pressure are not high enough to explain the incident alone. Likely remediation is upstream failover, provider escalation, and retry throttling. Reasoning: this summary interprets the evidence rather than repeating it. MCP supplied 29 correlated events; the RCA confidence is 0.75, so the recommended operator path is: Verify health and error rates for payment_gateway and identity_provider; Fail over or route around the impacted upstream dependency if supported; Throttle or cap retries to prevent retry amplification.","ai_reasoning":"Fallback RCA for payment-api indicates upstream dependency failure with moderate confidence. The latency spike is distributed across both hosts and key payment endpoints, while CPU and DB pool pressure are not high enough to explain the incident alone. Likely remediation is upstream failover, provider escalation, and retry throttling. Reasoning: this summary interprets the evidence rather than repeating it. MCP supplied 29 correlated events; the RCA confidence is 0.75, so the recommended operator path is: Verify health and error rates for payment_gateway and identity_provider; Fail over or route around the impacted upstream dependency if supported; Throttle or cap retries to prevent retry amplification.","llm_provider":"codex","mcp_evidence_summary":"MCP client call: MCP evidence for payment-api: 29 events; errors=latency_regression, upstream_api_failure; hosts=payment-01, payment-02; endpoints=/payments/authorize, /payments/capture; dependencies=identity_provider, none, payment_gateway, postgres; avg_latency_ms=340; max_latency_ms=1443; max_cpu_pct=72; max_db_pool_pct=67.","original_alert":"AIOps - Incident Candidate Alert","target_host":"unknown-host","mcp_investigation":true,"mcp_tools_used":["splunk_run_query"],"spl_queries_used":[],"mcp_log_event_count":29,"hec_status":{"status":"saved","index":"ai_triages"},"alert_payload":{"search_name":"AIOps - Incident Candidate Alert","result":{"_time":"1781341800","service":"payment-api","incident_id":"none","_time_bucket":"2026-06-13T14:41","signal_count":"1","signals":"latency_anomaly","error_types":"latency_regression","hosts":["CENTRAL","payment-02"],"endpoints":"/payments/capture","regions":"us-west","avg_latency":"1443","max_latency":"1443","affected_traces":"1","severity":"LOW","status_code":"200","correlation_score":"6","dedup_key":"payment-api|none|2026-06-13T14:41"},"sid":"rt_scheduler__splunk__search__RMD534075d6491c26eef_at_1781340679_1.107","app":"search","owner":"splunk","results_link":"http://DESKTOP-DFLMJNO:8000/app/search/@go?sid=rt_scheduler__splunk__search__RMD534075d6491c26eef_at_1781340679_1.107"},"source":"codex","sourcetype":"ai-mcp-triage-agent"}
